<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Comcel Q3 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Comcel Q3 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Comunicacion Celular SA (Comcel) reported the following third quarter results:</p>
<p>Net profit	 21.22 billion pesos vs loss 17.72 billion</p>
<p>Operating profit  6.93 billion pesos vs	 2.7 billion</p>
<p>Revenues	   44.9  billion pesos vs	30.3 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are unconsolidated and subject to approval by Colombia's Banking Superintendency.</p>
<p>--Tom Brown, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
